        "segments": [
          {
            "id": "s4_1",
            "speaker": "WILLIAM",
            "text": "The interview usually takes about an hour and you should arrange that about a week in advance.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s4_2",
            "speaker": "AMBER",
            "text": "I suppose I should dress smartly if it's for office work - I can probably borrow a suit from Mum.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s4_3",
            "speaker": "WILLIAM",
            "text": "Good idea. It's better to look too smart than too casual.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s4_4",
            "speaker": "AMBER",
            "text": "Will I need to bring copies of my exam certificates or anything like that?",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s4_5",
            "speaker": "WILLIAM",
            "text": "No - they don't need to see those, I don't think.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s4_6",
            "speaker": "AMBER",
            "text": "What about my passport?",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s4_7",
            "speaker": "WILLIAM",
            "text": "Oh yes - they will ask to see that.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s4_8",
            "speaker": "AMBER",
            "text": "OK.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s4_9",
            "speaker": "WILLIAM",
            "text": "I wouldn't get stressed about the interview though. It's just a chance for them to build a relationship with you - so they can try and match you to a job which you'll like. So there are questions about personality that they always ask candidates - fairly basic ones. And they probably won't ask anything too difficult like what your plans are for the future.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s4_10",
            "speaker": "AMBER",
            "text": "Hope not.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s4_11",
            "speaker": "WILLIAM",
            "text": "Anyway, there are lots of benefits to using an agency - for example, the interview will be useful because they'll give you feedback on your performance so you can improve next time.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s4_12",
            "speaker": "AMBER",
            "text": "And they'll have access to jobs which aren't advertised.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s4_13",
            "speaker": "WILLIAM",
            "text": "Exactly - most temporary jobs aren't advertised.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s4_14",
            "speaker": "AMBER",
            "text": "And I expect finding a temporary job this way takes a lot less time - it's much easier than ringing up individual companies.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s4_15",
            "speaker": "WILLIAM",
            "text": "Yes indeed. Well I think …",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          }
        ],
